# Studio registry

Import siblings with relative paths.
Import primitives from `@/components/ui/*`.
Import engine and runtime code from public `@mcut/*`.
Do not import `@/app/**`.
Do not use Next.js-only APIs in registry components.
Add a new registry file to `apps/studio/registry.json`.
Register user-visible commands in `action-registry.ts` and `editor-default-actions.ts`.
Run `bun run build` in `apps/studio` to regenerate `public/r`.
